{"4638890": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Beyond Camp Starling", "steam_appid": 4638890, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beyond Camp Starling is a dark atmospheric first-person adventure set around an old northern Wisconsin campground and the strange woods beyond the fence.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On graduation night, a group of teens gathers for one last quiet night before life pulls them apart. What begins as a familiar camping trip slowly turns into something stranger as moonlit trails shift, sounds carry through the fog, and pieces of local legend begin to feel uncomfortably real.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the campground, follow dialogue, complete quests, and uncover hidden clues as a quiet night in the north gets stranger by the minute.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4638890/extras/3df7f0d15513a5cf6245d271a9513bf4.avif?t=1782178338\" width=1076 height=580 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Explore a fog-covered campground and the woods beyond</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Follow simple story-driven quests</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Search for clues, hidden events, and strange discoveries</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Experience a slow-burn atmospheric adventure focused on mystery and exploration</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Uncover pieces of local legend without knowing what is waiting ahead</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beyond Camp Starling is a dark atmospheric first-person adventure set around an old northern Wisconsin campground and the strange woods beyond the fence.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On graduation night, a group of teens gathers for one last quiet night before life pulls them apart. What begins as a f